[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-3mtt-talent-registry-2026-career-opportunities-234":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},234,"3mtt-talent-registry-2026-career-opportunities-234","3mtt Talent Registry 2026: Career Opportunities","\u003Cp>The 3MTT Talent Registry is a Federal Government-backed initiative offering trained 3MTT fellows with over 3,000 tech job opportunities, offering minimum salaries of ₦150,000\u002Fmonth\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>In this post, the full details of the eligibility, benefits, timeline, and application procedure will be provided.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>3MTT Talent Registry Tech Jobs Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Host: 3MTT\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Finternships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Internships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Ftrainings\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Trainings\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Benefits\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Access to over 3,00 career opportunity\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Minimum of ₦150,000 Salary\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Career Growth\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: All Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: May 14, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>3MTT Talent Registry Details\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Federal Government-backed 3 Million Technical Talent (3MTT) programme has opened applications for its Talent Registry, creating access to about 3,000 technology job opportunities with a minimum monthly salary of N150,000.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The initiative, delivered in partnership with Skill Ladders and the National Information Technology Development Agency (NITDA), is designed to bridge the gap between digital skills training and actual employment within Nigeria’s growing tech ecosystem.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Ffederal-government-tvet-program-initiative\u002F\">Federal Government TVET Program 2026 (Technical and Vocational Education and Training)\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>3MTT Talent Registry Tech Jobs Benefits\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The 3MTT Talent Registry Tech Jobs offers:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Access to over 3,000 tech jobs\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Minimum earning potential from ₦150,000 monthly\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Career growth opportunities in the tech ecosystem\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Opportunity to gain industry experience\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Support for digital workforce development\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Available Fields for 3MTT Talent Registry\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>For the 3MTT Talent Registry Tech Jobs,  applications are open to the following programmes;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Software Development\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Data Analysis\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Cybersecurity\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Product Design\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Digital Marketing\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Other technology-related roles\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Federal Government 3MTT Program Requirements\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the 3MTT Talent Registry Tech Jobs, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be a Nigerian Citizen\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Have Interest or experience in digital and tech-related fields\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Have the ability to complete assessments and registration stages\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be committed to skill development and job placement process\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for 3MTT Talent Registry\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the 3MTT Talent Registry, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Read the information we have provided on this webpage and ensure your eligibility\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Visit the official application portal\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Create an account or log in if you already have one.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Complete profile registration and skill selection\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Take basic skills assessment\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Complete role-specific assessments\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Get matched with job opportunities\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Proceed to final employment phase\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","LINKSKOOL",16,"published",0,"2026-05-14 04:09:23",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002F3mtt-talent-registry-2026-career-opportunities\u002F6a053ce34e1c60.32782071_screenshot 2026-05-14 040321.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\